    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, but it feels a little too brief for a company-wide announcement. Could you expand on it? Maybe add a section on the specific types of discomfort people might feel if they ignore these tips—like tingling in the fingers or dull aches in the lower back—to emphasize why they should actually care about following the guidelines.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
