    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Can you add a little more personality to it? Maybe something to help it stick in people's minds. Like, you could describe how those small pains or weird sensations actually feel, kind of making it more relatable so it doesn't just feel like a boring HR manual. Just make sure it stays professional though.",
