    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To keep our energy high, let's treat our bodies like the great tools they are! Think about how frustrating it is when your fingers start tingles inexplicably, or that nagging, dull ache creeps into your lower back by midday. These aren't just minor annoyances; they are signals your body is asking for better support. By investing five minutes to adjust your monitor height or stand up during a break, you're preventing those frustrating sensations from becoming your daily norm. Let's work smarter and feel better while doing it!",
      "source": "target",
